        "text": "<p>AG1 Next Gen is designed to consolidate several daily supplements into one greens drink. A 13g serving supplies a broad range of micronutrients, including vitamins A, C, E and multiple B vitamins, alongside minerals, superfoods, prebiotics and antioxidants. The current formula also includes <strong>10 billion viable probiotic cells from five strains</strong>, intended to complement its prebiotic ingredients and support digestive health. The upgraded formula includes ingredients such as spirulina, chlorella, inulin, ginger, rhodiola, ashwagandha, reishi and shiitake, plus CoQ10 and alpha-lipoic acid. AG1 is also <strong>NSF Certified for Sport</strong>, meaning it undergoes testing relevant to athletes and banned substances. While convenient for filling some nutrient gaps, it shouldn't be considered a substitute for vegetables, fruit, protein and other whole foods in a balanced diet.</p>",
